<title>USA: Mass. sets $200 mln competitive bond sale in March.</title>
<headline>Mass. sets $200 mln competitive bond sale in March.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Massachusetts plans to sell approximately $200 million of general obligation bonds on March 12, according to a financial market source on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The sale would be through competition.</p>
<p>((--Joan Gralla, 212-859-1654))</p>
</text>
